## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical dataflow design for reliable at-least-once delivery and simple backpressure handling in a beginner context.

## Key Concepts
- Pull-based consumption with per-topic offsets
- Idempotent processing and offset commits
- Retry/backoff with jitter and restart replay
- Canary and integration testing

## Code Example
